[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4689837974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120202#issuecomment-4689837974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120202","id":4689837974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF4k_lg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:50:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:50:01Z","body":"I think churn from just changing the casing for the names of the libraries and standards isn't necessary, I don't think there's much confusion over it and if there has been I doubt this will resolve it","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4689837974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4689919506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120202#issuecomment-4689919506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120202","id":4689919506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF4p-Eg","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:58:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:58:24Z","body":"I disagree, at least on the doc side. Consistency is good on this front. The casing is a potential issue I can see localizations getting tripped over.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4689919506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4689936488","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120202#issuecomment-4689936488","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120202","id":4689936488,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF4rAaA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T10:00:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T10:10:30Z","body":"Are most translators or users likely to be aware that \"ZLIB\" is different from \"zlib\"?\r\n\r\nI think more explicit clarity in cases where it might cause confusion would be better, translators for languages that don't use letters (or use letters that don't distinguish case) might not catch this and translate it wrong, or translate it phonetically etc., and the users themselves might not comprehend the significance in the same way","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4689936488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694693872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120202#issuecomment-4694693872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120202","id":4694693872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF9NX8A","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T19:44:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T19:56:59Z","body":"Admittedly, I started this originally to address the `COMPRESSION_DEFLATE` case. The others were mostly things I found and saw as a problem.\r\n\r\nMy next proposal is this:\r\n\r\n- \"DEFLATE\" should be written either in title case or all caps. All caps is more widely used and may make it harder to get translated by mistake.\r\n- \"zlib\" should always be written in lowercase for both algorithm and software.\r\n\t- It should not be \"ZLib\" (uppercase Z and L), which in my vision would be as wrong as \"GoDot\".\r\n\t- \"Zlib\" should only ever be used as the short identifier for the \"zlib License\".\r\n- \"Zstd\" may be used for the software or as an abbreviation for the algorithm.\r\n- \"Zstandard\" may be used for the algorithm but not the software.\r\n- \"gzip\" is pretty much the same case as zlib (all lowercase and not \"GZip\").\r\n- \"brotli/Brotli\" is pretty much the same case as Zstd and Zstandard, but since the software is almost never mentioned, I decided to go with the title case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694693872/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]